3. AOSP LatinIME wordlists

Kinetica can import an AOSP-format "wordlist.combined" dictionary supplied
by the user (Settings > Dictionary). The Turkish dictionary build/test path
can also merge the AOSP-derived main_tr.combined wordlist from:
https://codeberg.org/Helium314/aosp-dictionaries

The AOSP LatinIME wordlists are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
The downloaded source is not committed as a raw file. When the optional AOSP
merge is used, the resulting Turkish wordlist includes surface forms from this
Apache-licensed source. Keep this notice with builds made using that merge.

