Additional build-time tool: Zemberek-NLP Turkish morphology
Version: 0.17.1
Source: https://github.com/ahmetaa/zemberek-nlp
License: Apache License 2.0
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Kinetica uses Zemberek-NLP only in the build/CI environment to propose a
bounded set of Turkish noun/verb inflected surface forms. The morphology
library and its full lexicon are not included in the Android APK. Generated
forms are filtered, frequency-capped and limited before inclusion in the
Turkish wordlist. Zemberek remains a separately licensed third-party tool.
